      "Expectations changed in existing tests: 'prefer a sealed source, then a cache, then a carrier sighting' now expects a start no-lead, then a bought (targeted) sighting where it used to expect a deferred start sighting. The 'deferred sightings' describe's spentAtFirstBoundary now spends A's sighting on a bought storm sighting instead of a deferred start one. The assertions of both deferred tests are otherwise unchanged.",
